{"candidateAnswer":"Someone close to him introduced him to it and encouraged him to try it out.","evidence":"[D1:14 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Evan: Yep, it's a great stress-buster. I started doing this a few years back.\n[D1:15 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Sam: Wow, that's impressive! How did you get into watercolor painting?\n[D1:16 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Evan: My friend got me into it and gave me some advice, and I was hooked right away!\n[D8:14 | 6:17 pm on 19 August, 2023] Evan: Thanks, Sam! It all started when a friend of mine gave me this painting one day, it inspired me a lot and that's when I started painting. And I joined the classes to find like-minded people and show them what I can do, you can always improve your skills.","itemId":"urn:uuid:c9b0cb16-1417-5548-8419-f488a3cc2bff","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:27f8b116488deb0a876c641d1b3f3361f8f8e91a8d1096e4813c41e4441a39c5","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How did Evan get into painting?","referenceAnswer":"His friend got him into it by gifting him a painting and giving him some advice. The painting inspired Evan.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"27f8b116488deb0a876c641d1b3f3361f8f8e91a8d1096e4813c41e4441a39c5"}}]}